.TH RECVMMSG 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
recvmmsg \- Linux x86-64 syscall 299
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int recvmmsg(int descriptor, struct crunch_mmsghdr* messages, unsigned int count, unsigned int flags, struct timespec* timeout);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Receives multiple messages. Each message uses the Linux x86-64 mmsghdr layout. Linux may modify timeout.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR recvmmsg (2)
